WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.615
The rest of the day, Vinnie and Mandy were busy.

2
00:00:04.616 --> 00:00:09.145
They had many chores to do!

3
00:00:09.146 --> 00:00:14.668
So the next morning, the children headed straight for the attic.

4
00:00:14.669 --> 00:00:18.679
"Where’s the photo?" Mandy asked.

5
00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:23.220
"Here." Vinnie pulled it out of his pocket.

6
00:00:23.221 --> 00:00:26.189
"Mandy!" he cried.

7
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.876
"The sail and shields stopped glowing!"

8
00:00:29.877 --> 00:00:33.173
The old man was gone from the photo.

9
00:00:33.174 --> 00:00:38.684
Instead, Vinnie and Mandy were standing by the Viking ship.

10
00:00:38.685 --> 00:00:42.414
Vinnie put the picture back in the album.

11
00:00:42.415 --> 00:00:46.275
Then he turned the page.

12
00:00:46.276 --> 00:00:51.211
"Mandy, look at this!" Vinnie exclaimed.

13
00:00:51.212 --> 00:00:53.941
"Here’s a new glowing picture!"

14
00:00:53.942 --> 00:00:56.866
Mandy stared at the photo.

15
00:00:56.867 --> 00:01:05.539
The old man stood next to a statue of a woman with a tall helmet.

16
00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:08.933
The helmet was glowing.

17
00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:14.870
The tall statue had a small winged figure in one hand.

18
00:01:14.871 --> 00:01:17.813
The other hand held a shield.

19
00:01:17.814 --> 00:01:21.473
"Where is this?" asked Vinnie.

20
00:01:21.474 --> 00:01:24.800
"I don’t know," said Mandy.

21
00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:28.333
She took the photo to look more closely.

22
00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:33.015
Suddenly, they heard footsteps climbing the stairs.

23
00:01:33.016 --> 00:01:35.590
"What are you doing up there, kids?"

24
00:01:35.591 --> 00:01:37.066
It was Dad.

25
00:01:37.067 --> 00:01:41.742
"What should we do?" Mandy whispered.

26
00:01:41.743 --> 00:01:46.602
"Our adventures can’t stop now!" Vinnie said.

27
00:01:46.603 --> 00:01:50.946
They stared at the glowing helmet on the statue.

28
00:01:50.947 --> 00:01:57.277
They closed their eyes and fell down the deep dark tunnel.

29
00:01:57.278 --> 00:02:03.535
"Ow!" yelled Vinnie as he landed on a hard floor.

30
00:02:03.536 --> 00:02:08.950
"Hey!" he shouted as Mandy fell on top of him.

31
00:02:08.951 --> 00:02:16.040
"Sorry!" Mandy cried. "I can’t help where I land."

32
00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:20.603
The children were in a room with baskets filled with thread.

33
00:02:20.604 --> 00:02:24.210
The rolls of thread were many different colors.

34
00:02:24.211 --> 00:02:30.075
A beautiful piece of cloth hung from a large wooden frame.

35
00:02:30.076 --> 00:02:35.077
"What’s that?" asked Vinnie, pointing.

36
00:02:35.078 --> 00:02:38.862
"I think it’s a loom," guessed Mandy.

37
00:02:38.863 --> 00:02:41.869
"You know, to weave cloth."

38
00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:44.736
"Look at what we’re wearing!"

39
00:02:44.737 --> 00:02:48.412
Vinnie stood up to admire his clothes.

40
00:02:48.413 --> 00:02:51.667
He wore a short white tunic.

41
00:02:51.668 --> 00:02:55.187
Mandy had on a white tunic too.

42
00:02:55.188 --> 00:02:58.206
But hers reached to her ankles.

43
00:02:58.207 --> 00:03:03.609
Both tunics were fastened with small pins at the shoulders.

44
00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:06.536
The children heard voices.

45
00:03:06.537 --> 00:03:10.479
"Someone’s coming!" whispered Mandy.

46
00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:14.692
The children looked around for a place to hide.

47
00:03:14.693 --> 00:03:18.213
Too late—the door opened.

48
00:03:18.214 --> 00:03:21.009
Vinnie and Mandy froze.

49
00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:24.072
Two young girls walked in.

50
00:03:24.073 --> 00:03:28.406
One girl, dressed in blue, stared at them.

51
00:03:28.407 --> 00:03:30.636
"What are you doing here?"

52
00:03:30.637 --> 00:03:33.407
she demanded, pointing at Vinnie.

53
00:03:33.408 --> 00:03:38.415
"Uh, well, I, uh . . . ," stuttered Vinnie.

54
00:03:38.416 --> 00:03:43.338
"How dare you step inside the weaving room!" she shouted.

55
00:03:43.339 --> 00:03:50.460
"My father will not allow this!"

